Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.197.198.120","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3c96bbef7767c3fe6f9fb5cb123af389","RawContent":"We are getting married June 14, 2016. I am needing ideas on what people do for their guest activities. \n\nIs everyone planning a welcome party? If so are you paying for private cocktail hour, or having everyone just meet at bar? We are wanting to do group excursion one day. Our group will range from 1-75 years old so not sure what will work for that range. \n\nAre you offering guests one paid activity and list of optional ones for other days that are non paid? I thought about putting list of local ideas from golf tee costs to snorkel in the oot packet so guests can pick their own.","Attachments":[],"Id":1907672,"PostDate":1447844008,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are getting married June 14, 2016. I am needing ideas on what people do for their guest activities. <br>\nIs everyone planning a welcome party? If so are you paying for private cocktail hour, or having everyone just meet at bar? We are wanting to do group excursion one day. Our group will range from 1-75 years old so not sure what will work for that range. <br>\nAre you offering guests one paid activity and list of optional ones for other days that are non paid? I thought about putting list of local ideas from golf tee costs to snorkel in the oot packet so guests can pick their own. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leslietenille@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.145.30.250","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440799494,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284602.jpg?_r=1452028640","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"LesTee","Id":284602,"Name":"LesTee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"4.53.94.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"75f84f04156fe960aa6d763355b39be9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"LesTee\" post=\"1907672\" timestamp=\"1447862008\"]\nWe are getting married June 14, 2016. I am needing ideas on what people do for their guest activities.\nIs everyone planning a welcome party? If so are you paying for private cocktail hour, or having everyone just meet at bar? We are wanting to do group excursion one day. Our group will range from 1-75 years old so not sure what will work for that range.\nAre you offering guests one paid activity and list of optional ones for other days that are non paid? I thought about putting list of local ideas from golf tee costs to snorkel in the oot packet so guests can pick their own.[\/quote]\nWe are hosting a private catamaran cruise (3 hours, open bar and snacks) on Friday.  Outside of that and the typical wedding stuff (ceremony, photos, reception), everyone is on their own.  \n\nWe made a list of potential excursions and put them on our website, but we are not offering to make arrangements for anything else.  It&#039;s too much to manage and we figured people wanted some time to do their own thing.","Attachments":[],"Id":1907714,"PostDate":1447942673,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>LesTee, on 18 November 2015 - 10:53 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>We are getting married June 14, 2016. I am needing ideas on what people do for their guest activities.<br>\nIs everyone planning a welcome party? If so are you paying for private cocktail hour, or having everyone just meet at bar? We are wanting to do group excursion one day. Our group will range from 1-75 years old so not sure what will work for that range.<br>\nAre you offering guests one paid activity and list of optional ones for other days that are non paid? I thought about putting list of local ideas from golf tee costs to snorkel in the oot packet so guests can pick their own.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are hosting a private catamaran cruise (3 hours, open bar and snacks) on Friday. \u00a0Outside of that and the typical wedding stuff (ceremony, photos, reception), everyone is on their own. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We made a list of potential excursions and put them on our website, but we are not offering to make arrangements for anything else. \u00a0It's too much to manage and we figured people wanted some time to do their own thing. \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashley225@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.117.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426927785,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282492.jpg?_r=1450918742","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AshleyNYC323","Id":282492,"Name":"AshleyNYC323","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.242.233.243","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ddba11a689e913435bbeab17efd66cd3","RawContent":"Hi brides! Congrats to everyone on their upcoming weddings! We have booked for October 2016, and we are still waiting to receive confirmation on date, time and locations. We still haven&#039;t received any cost details about services offered. \n\n\nDoes anyone know how much the bridal suite is and how to reserve it?\n\nCan you extend your private reception?\n\nIs there a cost to set up decorations you are bringing?\n\n\nThanks :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1908103,"PostDate":1449185476,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi brides! Congrats to everyone on their upcoming weddings! We have booked for October 2016, and we are still waiting to receive confirmation on date, time and locations. We still haven't received any cost details about services offered. <br><br>\nDoes anyone know how much the bridal suite is and how to reserve it?<br>\nCan you extend your private reception?<br>\nIs there a cost to set up decorations you are bringing?<br><br>\nThanks <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ssheridan03@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.242.233.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1449178795,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sheridan2016","Id":285512,"Name":"Sheridan2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.145.30.250","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a86ce21e9bce2230f3eedb869c37b7b7","RawContent":"The contract is 150 for suite. I just sent it in. I emailed the spa directly to ask and they sent me paperwork. We are extending our reception by a hour- you just pay the 12\/18pp for alcohol. You pay based on initial number of people, not on how many stay during the extended time. I asked, just in case people want to leave early.\n\n\nI&#039;m curious about setup costs too. My WC said 20% of their cost would apply to things I bring other than favors, menus, table numbers. Wondered if it was the personalization part that allows it to be used free.","Attachments":[],"Id":1908104,"PostDate":1449189013,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                The contract is 150 for suite. I just sent it in. I emailed the spa directly to ask and they sent me paperwork. We are extending our reception by a hour- you just pay the 12\/18pp for alcohol. You pay based on initial number of people, not on how many stay during the extended time. I asked, just in case people want to leave early.<br><br>\nI'm curious about setup costs too. My WC said 20% of their cost would apply to things I bring other than favors, menus, table numbers. Wondered if it was the personalization part that allows it to be used free. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leslietenille@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.145.30.250","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440799494,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284602.jpg?_r=1452028640","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"LesTee","Id":284602,"Name":"LesTee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.145.30.250","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f4d7b8fb0053734fd9fc53ed35e36c4b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I just got an email saying the suite is confirmed for June. I have been emailing Vanessa, she is the spa manager.&amp;nbsp; spa.nolpc@nowresorts.com&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908111,"PostDate":1449225978,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I just got an email saying the suite is confirmed for June. I have been emailing Vanessa, she is the spa manager.\u00a0 spa.nolpc@nowresorts.com\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leslietenille@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.145.30.250","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440799494,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284602.jpg?_r=1452028640","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"LesTee","Id":284602,"Name":"LesTee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.242.233.243","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39bb15a1f2b25b7adc00c2d532dffffc","RawContent":"Thanks you so much! I really appreciate the info! I&#039;m dying to get the pricing for extras from the resort to start planning. \n\n\nIf I hear anything I&#039;ll be sure to post :)\n\n\nThanks again!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1908118,"PostDate":1449243368,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks you so much! I really appreciate the info! I'm dying to get the pricing for extras from the resort to start planning. <br><br>\nIf I hear anything I'll be sure to post <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nThanks again!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ssheridan03@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.242.233.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1449178795,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sheridan2016","Id":285512,"Name":"Sheridan2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.17.193.73","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba0df96d46b1e3629a808eb09eb0fe6e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"AshleyNYC323\"] &amp;nbsp;That&#039;s so awesome! My fianc\u00e9 and I are thinking of doing a private catamaran cruise too! We just got a quote from Sanael. Who are you thinking of booking with?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908207,"PostDate":1449535490,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282492\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282492-ashleynyc323\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">AshleyNYC323<\/span><\/a> \u00a0That's so awesome! My fianc\u00e9 and I are thinking of doing a private catamaran cruise too! We just got a quote from Sanael. Who are you thinking of booking with?\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"inessential.emails@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.140.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442195398,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ann123","Id":284806,"Name":"ann123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.152.35.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df151eabeac7b78490b80bf3032d2981","RawContent":"[quote name=\"ann123\" post=\"1908207\" timestamp=\"1449553490\"]\n@[member=\"AshleyNYC323\"]  That&#039;s so awesome! My fianc\u00e9 and I are thinking of doing a private catamaran cruise too! We just got a quote from Sanael. Who are you thinking of booking with?[\/quote]\nThat&#039;s exactly who we are using.   We really wanted things to be simple... this is going to be our gift to everyone, vs. doing a tote bag or any other kind of favor.  I can&#039;t wait!","Attachments":[],"Id":1908240,"PostDate":1449610353,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>ann123, on 08 December 2015 - 12:44 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282492\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282492-ashleynyc323\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">AshleyNYC323<\/span><\/a> \u00a0That's so awesome! My fianc\u00e9 and I are thinking of doing a private catamaran cruise too! We just got a quote from Sanael. Who are you thinking of booking with?\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That's exactly who we are using. \u00a0 We really wanted things to be simple... this is going to be our gift to everyone, vs. doing a tote bag or any other kind of favor. \u00a0I can't wait!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashley225@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.117.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426927785,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282492.jpg?_r=1450918742","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AshleyNYC323","Id":282492,"Name":"AshleyNYC323","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.17.193.73","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"261fb9d6c92bff54f370bf5c74b66e63","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"AshleyNYC323\"] OMG! That&#039;s so awesome! How is your planning going? We&#039;re planning on doing a reception on the boat! Isn&#039;t it so cool how they can pick up your guests on the beach at the resort? Unfortunately I&#039;m staying at a resort where they can&#039;t do this.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908242,"PostDate":1449614818,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282492\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282492-ashleynyc323\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">AshleyNYC323<\/span><\/a> OMG! That's so awesome! How is your planning going? We're planning on doing a reception on the boat! Isn't it so cool how they can pick up your guests on the beach at the resort? Unfortunately I'm staying at a resort where they can't do this.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"inessential.emails@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.140.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442195398,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ann123","Id":284806,"Name":"ann123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.152.35.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0b84165b1b169628e4d36c20a783773c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"ann123\" post=\"1908242\" timestamp=\"1449632818\"]\n@[member=\"AshleyNYC323\"] OMG! That&#039;s so awesome! How is your planning going? We&#039;re planning on doing a reception on the boat! Isn&#039;t it so cool how they can pick up your guests on the beach at the resort? Unfortunately I&#039;m staying at a resort where they can&#039;t do this.[\/quote]It is cool - that is a big part of why we picked them ... we just want everything to be super simple.\nOur planning is pretty much done!    We have all of our final RSVPs and everyone&#039;s final payment is due Jan 15.\nAfter that, I just need to move across the country, find a new job, find a house.... lol\nOur life situation is funny so the wedding is actually last on my list right now.\n\nHow about yours???","Attachments":[],"Id":1908272,"PostDate":1449699918,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>ann123, on 08 December 2015 - 10:46 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282492\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282492-ashleynyc323\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">AshleyNYC323<\/span><\/a> OMG! That's so awesome! How is your planning going? We're planning on doing a reception on the boat! Isn't it so cool how they can pick up your guests on the beach at the resort? Unfortunately I'm staying at a resort where they can't do this.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>It is cool - that is a big part of why we picked them ... we just want everything to be super simple.<\/p>\n<p>Our planning is pretty much done! \u00a0 \u00a0We have all of our final RSVPs and everyone's final payment is due Jan 15.<\/p>\n<p>After that, I just need to move across the country, find a new job, find a house.... lol<\/p>\n<p>Our life situation is funny so the wedding is actually last on my list right now.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How about yours???<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashley225@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.117.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426927785,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282492.jpg?_r=1450918742","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AshleyNYC323","Id":282492,"Name":"AshleyNYC323","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":52,"TotalPages":6,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":50},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
