> User dl0478 (284081)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.17.193.73","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c899999b7cf94e682da5b26afb8554aa","RawContent":"[quote name=\"AshleyNYC323\" post=\"1908272\" timestamp=\"1449717918\"]\nIt is cool - that is a big part of why we picked them ... we just want everything to be super simple.\nOur planning is pretty much done!    We have all of our final RSVPs and everyone&#039;s final payment is due Jan 15.\nAfter that, I just need to move across the country, find a new job, find a house.... lol\nOur life situation is funny so the wedding is actually last on my list right now.\n\nHow about yours???[\/quote]\nTerrible! I sent our priest the mailing address a few weeks ago and today I found out that he will be forwarding the address on Monday! So I&#039;m not too comfortable putting down any deposits for the catamaran cruise since the day hasn&#039;t been secured with the church yet, plus we&#039;re still working on what we&#039;d like for the cruise. Did you ask for anything specific? We&#039;re thinking of the crazy hour. Our rsvp date is on Monday too, so we actually don&#039;t know how many people will be going. Luckily we didn&#039;t invite too many people so everyone should be easy to track down. I probably should&#039;ve picked up a wedding planning book or something; I&#039;ve been pretty much planning on the fly, haha! \n\nOh wow! Moving? Good luck! New scenery is always cool. Either my fianc\u00e9 or I will be moving too. We live about 17 hours apart.","Attachments":[],"Id":1908484,"PostDate":1450480931,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>AshleyNYC323, on 09 December 2015 - 10:25 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>It is cool - that is a big part of why we picked them ... we just want everything to be super simple.<\/p>\n<p>Our planning is pretty much done! \u00a0 \u00a0We have all of our final RSVPs and everyone's final payment is due Jan 15.<\/p>\n<p>After that, I just need to move across the country, find a new job, find a house.... lol<\/p>\n<p>Our life situation is funny so the wedding is actually last on my list right now.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How about yours???<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Terrible! I sent our priest the mailing address a few weeks ago and today I found out that he will be forwarding the address on Monday! So I'm not too comfortable putting down any deposits for the catamaran cruise since the day hasn't been secured with the church yet, plus we're still working on what we'd like for the cruise. Did you ask for anything specific? We're thinking of the crazy hour. Our rsvp date is on Monday too, so we actually don't know how many people will be going. Luckily we didn't invite too many people so everyone should be easy to track down. I probably should've picked up a wedding planning book or something; I've been pretty much planning on the fly, haha!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Oh wow! Moving? Good luck! New scenery is always cool. Either my fianc\u00e9 or I will be moving too. We live about 17 hours apart.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"inessential.emails@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.140.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442195398,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ann123","Id":284806,"Name":"ann123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.145.30.250","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0b12340464dc522f889193cb8d396a41","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Sorry for the small vent! am hoping someone on here as some great advice. Today we received 7 peoples rsvp- that have decided to go with booking their own trip on various websites. Its not so much that, as they are coming and leaving on different days than the travel agent had reserved. My future in-laws just informed me they are not flying in til the day before the wedding. She told me they would be there sometime&amp;nbsp;the afternoon before. They are planning a long trip, and want to use the DR as the&amp;nbsp;jumping off point for seeing more islands. They already have booked flights. Ugh.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I had been looking at doing a group excursion the day before the wedding instead of a rehearsal dinner - I wrongly assumed my fianc\u00e9s family would be there in advanced.&amp;nbsp; His sister is also coming the day before as well! &amp;nbsp;How have other people rehearsed? Does excursions the day after sound ok? I can not see people wanting to get up at 8am, so guess I would need something that allows people to recover. I was wanting to do the excursions before the wedding to allow people to meet and talk.&amp;nbsp; I guess back to drawing board for welcome ideas.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908570,"PostDate":1450738975,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Sorry for the small vent! am hoping someone on here as some great advice. Today we received 7 peoples rsvp- that have decided to go with booking their own trip on various websites. Its not so much that, as they are coming and leaving on different days than the travel agent had reserved. My future in-laws just informed me they are not flying in til the day before the wedding. She told me they would be there sometime\u00a0the afternoon before. They are planning a long trip, and want to use the DR as the\u00a0jumping off point for seeing more islands. They already have booked flights. Ugh.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I had been looking at doing a group excursion the day before the wedding instead of a rehearsal dinner - I wrongly assumed my fianc\u00e9s family would be there in advanced.\u00a0 His sister is also coming the day before as well! \u00a0How have other people rehearsed? Does excursions the day after sound ok? I can not see people wanting to get up at 8am, so guess I would need something that allows people to recover. I was wanting to do the excursions before the wedding to allow people to meet and talk.\u00a0 I guess back to drawing board for welcome ideas.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leslietenille@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.145.30.250","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440799494,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284602.jpg?_r=1452028640","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"LesTee","Id":284602,"Name":"LesTee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.117.175.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cb30463106ece44336beee0e108ad653","RawContent":"[quote name=\"LesTee\" post=\"1908570\" timestamp=\"1450756975\"]\nSorry for the small vent! am hoping someone on here as some great advice. Today we received 7 peoples rsvp- that have decided to go with booking their own trip on various websites. Its not so much that, as they are coming and leaving on different days than the travel agent had reserved. My future in-laws just informed me they are not flying in til the day before the wedding. She told me they would be there sometime the afternoon before. They are planning a long trip, and want to use the DR as the jumping off point for seeing more islands. They already have booked flights. Ugh.\n\nI had been looking at doing a group excursion the day before the wedding instead of a rehearsal dinner - I wrongly assumed my fianc\u00e9s family would be there in advanced.  His sister is also coming the day before as well!  How have other people rehearsed? Does excursions the day after sound ok? I can not see people wanting to get up at 8am, so guess I would need something that allows people to recover. I was wanting to do the excursions before the wedding to allow people to meet and talk.  I guess back to drawing board for welcome ideas.[\/quote]\nI think planning a group excursion is a bit much, honestly.  I just returned from my wedding week at Secrets and most people just wanted to relax at the pool or beach.  It&#039;s hard to please everyone with something like excursions.  We did a \"rehearsal\" dinner at La Riviera the night before the and afterwards most people ended up at the casino or other bars.  We also did a farewell breakfast at La Riviera the morning after the wedding.   To get people to meet we did a \"meet and greet\" at Rendezvous bar 2 days before the wedding.  Some people didn&#039;t get there until the day before and that was their loss.  You can&#039;t please everyone.  One of the groomsman was literally there less than 48 hours.","Attachments":[],"Id":1908610,"PostDate":1450805512,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>LesTee, on 21 December 2015 - 11:02 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Sorry for the small vent! am hoping someone on here as some great advice. Today we received 7 peoples rsvp- that have decided to go with booking their own trip on various websites. Its not so much that, as they are coming and leaving on different days than the travel agent had reserved. My future in-laws just informed me they are not flying in til the day before the wedding. She told me they would be there sometime\u00a0the afternoon before. They are planning a long trip, and want to use the DR as the\u00a0jumping off point for seeing more islands. They already have booked flights. Ugh.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I had been looking at doing a group excursion the day before the wedding instead of a rehearsal dinner - I wrongly assumed my fianc\u00e9s family would be there in advanced.\u00a0 His sister is also coming the day before as well! \u00a0How have other people rehearsed? Does excursions the day after sound ok? I can not see people wanting to get up at 8am, so guess I would need something that allows people to recover. I was wanting to do the excursions before the wedding to allow people to meet and talk.\u00a0 I guess back to drawing board for welcome ideas.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think planning a group excursion is a bit much, honestly. \u00a0I just returned from my wedding week at Secrets and most people just wanted to relax at the pool or beach. \u00a0It's hard to please everyone with something like excursions. \u00a0We did a \"rehearsal\" dinner at La Riviera the night before the and afterwards most people ended up at the casino or other bars. \u00a0We also did a farewell breakfast at La Riviera the morning after the wedding. \u00a0 To get people to meet we did a \"meet and greet\" at Rendezvous bar 2 days before the wedding. \u00a0Some people didn't get there until the day before and that was their loss. \u00a0You can't please everyone. \u00a0One of the groomsman was literally there less than 48 hours. \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amandagguerra@gmail.com","IpAddress":"199.200.25.52","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1433260699,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"agg1975","Id":283358,"Name":"agg1975","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.145.30.250","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fe821057fe27caddc5f8da161d08c5f6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Does anyone know if the resort allows children in the bar area for things like meet and greets?&amp;nbsp; Or is there a different location that everyone could meet up? The ironic part of my situation is that my future in laws gave us money to pay for excursion as a thank you to our guests. We hadn&#039;t even considered it til they mentioned it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Did other people have their guests just not use the travel agency? So far only one couple has used our agency, the others haven&#039;t even contacted our agent before booking their own trips.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908611,"PostDate":1450806287,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Does anyone know if the resort allows children in the bar area for things like meet and greets?\u00a0 Or is there a different location that everyone could meet up? The ironic part of my situation is that my future in laws gave us money to pay for excursion as a thank you to our guests. We hadn't even considered it til they mentioned it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did other people have their guests just not use the travel agency? So far only one couple has used our agency, the others haven't even contacted our agent before booking their own trips.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leslietenille@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.145.30.250","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440799494,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284602.jpg?_r=1452028640","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"LesTee","Id":284602,"Name":"LesTee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.6.43.224","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0426ffdfaec6da445d2326c23c6d88fc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"LesTee\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m assuming that since Now Larimar is not an adult only resort that children can pretty much go anywhere with adults.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am getting married in May and did not set up a travel agent for booking. &amp;nbsp;My fiances sister got married in DR in July and went through a travel agent after looking at various websites we were actually able to find a much cheaper price for the flight and hotel so we ended up not using her travel agent. &amp;nbsp;When we booked our trip for May we went through Bookit.com and got a great deal!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908613,"PostDate":1450808804,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284602\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284602-lestee\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">LesTee<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm assuming that since Now Larimar is not an adult only resort that children can pretty much go anywhere with adults.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am getting married in May and did not set up a travel agent for booking. \u00a0My fiances sister got married in DR in July and went through a travel agent after looking at various websites we were actually able to find a much cheaper price for the flight and hotel so we ended up not using her travel agent. \u00a0When we booked our trip for May we went through Bookit.com and got a great deal!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.laurel.ripley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.54.222.28","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437631381,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MelissaLaurel","Id":284093,"Name":"MelissaLaurel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.117.175.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8c17ec12bb7281d1dffc851f7fe0b2b9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"LesTee\" post=\"1908611\" timestamp=\"1450824287\"]\nDoes anyone know if the resort allows children in the bar area for things like meet and greets?  Or is there a different location that everyone could meet up? The ironic part of my situation is that my future in laws gave us money to pay for excursion as a thank you to our guests. We hadn&#039;t even considered it til they mentioned it.\n\nDid other people have their guests just not use the travel agency? So far only one couple has used our agency, the others haven&#039;t even contacted our agent before booking their own trips.[\/quote]I didn&#039;t see any children in any of the bars at NOW, but that doesn&#039;t mean they weren&#039;t allowed inside.  I honestly don&#039;t know.   There is always the main plaza area at NOW to meet too.  There were children all over the plaza.\n\nExcept for the 6 rooms we booked for our immediate family, everyone else booked on their own.  Some booked directly with resort, some used a travel agent.  Are you financially obligated to have a certain number of rooms booked through the travel agent?  \n\nI put together welcome bags for our guests and they were a huge hit.  It was a lot of work, but I think my guests really appreciated it.  Personally, I think doing a group excursion will be hit or miss.  It is a nice sentiment, but unless you know that all of your guests will actually want to do it, it could be a waste of money.  I get horrible motion sickness and I know many other people do too, so I wouldn&#039;t do anything on the water.  Just my opinion.","Attachments":[],"Id":1908629,"PostDate":1450863527,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>LesTee, on 22 December 2015 - 05:44 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Does anyone know if the resort allows children in the bar area for things like meet and greets?\u00a0 Or is there a different location that everyone could meet up? The ironic part of my situation is that my future in laws gave us money to pay for excursion as a thank you to our guests. We hadn't even considered it til they mentioned it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did other people have their guests just not use the travel agency? So far only one couple has used our agency, the others haven't even contacted our agent before booking their own trips.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I didn't see any children in any of the bars at NOW, but that doesn't mean they weren't allowed inside. \u00a0I honestly don't know. \u00a0 There is always the main plaza area at NOW to meet too. \u00a0There were children all over the plaza.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Except for the 6 rooms we booked for our immediate family, everyone else booked on their own. \u00a0Some booked directly with resort, some used a travel agent. \u00a0Are you financially obligated to have a certain number of rooms booked through the travel agent? \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I put together welcome bags for our guests and they were a huge hit. \u00a0It was a lot of work, but I think my guests really appreciated it. \u00a0Personally, I think doing a group excursion will be hit or miss. \u00a0It is a nice sentiment, but unless you know that all of your guests will actually want to do it, it could be a waste of money. \u00a0I get horrible motion sickness and I know many other people do too, so I wouldn't do anything on the water. \u00a0Just my opinion. \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amandagguerra@gmail.com","IpAddress":"199.200.25.52","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1433260699,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"agg1975","Id":283358,"Name":"agg1975","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.69.8.108","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9aef806d828a8741c0286a715bfb6b57","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"AshleyNYC323\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hey AshleyNYC323! You&#039;re probably really busy with the holidays, but I was just wondering how you made your deposit to catamaran cruise company. They didn&#039;t specify, but they want us to pay before Dec 31 to secure 2015 pricing :S&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908776,"PostDate":1451449535,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282492\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282492-ashleynyc323\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">AshleyNYC323<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hey AshleyNYC323! You're probably really busy with the holidays, but I was just wondering how you made your deposit to catamaran cruise company. They didn't specify, but they want us to pay before Dec 31 to secure 2015 pricing :S\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"inessential.emails@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.140.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442195398,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ann123","Id":284806,"Name":"ann123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.45.13.57","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fab0eda9537e5208ff1dddb00331029d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We get married on 29 January! &amp;nbsp;So excited. &amp;nbsp;Does anyone have a picture of the sashes with place cards they used on the back of the chairs?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Samantha&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909017,"PostDate":1452028933,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We get married on 29 January! \u00a0So excited. \u00a0Does anyone have a picture of the sashes with place cards they used on the back of the chairs?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Samantha<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samantha620@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.45.13.57","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1452028690,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285789.jpg?_r=1453776664","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"SamanthaD","Id":285789,"Name":"SamanthaD","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.152.18.255","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3be129217ddadc1dfa893078d3924dc5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello everyone and Congrats to you all!!! My Fiance&#039; and I will be at the Resort May 1-8, our wedding will be on May 6 at the Fountain, with a Beach reception :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910022,"PostDate":1453751097,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello everyone and Congrats to you all!!! My Fiance' and I will be at the Resort May 1-8, our wedding will be on May 6 at the Fountain, with a Beach reception <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shannonrcollier@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.125.249.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424866343,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282250.jpg?_r=1424884899","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":209,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MyJourneytoMrs","Id":282250,"Name":"MyJourneytoMrs","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.38.56","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a317883d9415776bf49886583ecfa0fb","RawContent":"Congrats! My date is april 08  it&#039;s coming up quick!! \n\nNow I&#039;m just finishing small details. My wedding is on the beach","Attachments":[],"Id":1910056,"PostDate":1453799218,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats! My date is april 08  it's coming up quick!! <br>\nNow I'm just finishing small details. My wedding is on the beach \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah.scammell@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.22.192","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430416834,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Soontobemrsminogue","Id":282930,"Name":"Soontobemrsminogue","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":52,"TotalPages":6,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":50},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
