{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14821,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"72bcca19fa545996034aac9099a80060","RawContent":"Looking at your colors I think a metallic gold pen would look lovely on the dark brown envelopes. I used metallic silver on my dark pink envelopes and it really popped and added a little something special. Have fun!","Attachments":[],"Id":270879,"PostDate":1208408498,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Looking at your colors I think a metallic gold pen would look lovely on the dark brown envelopes. I used metallic silver on my dark pink envelopes and it really popped and added a little something special. Have fun!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mrsjamyjones@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.201.254.135","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1168253040,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207039.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":1000,"PhotoHeight":667,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"starchild","Id":207039,"Name":"starchild","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14821,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"033765282237d1a984fca58c176af25d","RawContent":"white or silver gel pen or transparent labels with light color ink.","Attachments":[],"Id":270888,"PostDate":1208415801,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                white or silver gel pen or transparent labels with light color ink.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/LT1fp9.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/LT1fp9.png<\/a><strong>BarefootBride<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cosey.lewis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1199876305,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208177.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BarefootBride","Id":208177,"Name":"BarefootBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14821,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"36a820cc2b592d6edd8192871bbda5fb","RawContent":"I had dark navy envelopes and used labels on mine! It will be a little time consuming, but the bonus with labels is that you can save the copy and keep it for the RSVP&#039;s, Thank You cards, and for holiday cards. So, it may be time consuming now, but it is worth it in the end!! Just my two cents! (BTW-I love you color scheme! Very pretty!)","Attachments":[],"Id":270906,"PostDate":1208424864,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I had dark navy envelopes and used labels on mine! It will be a little time consuming, but the bonus with labels is that you can save the copy and keep it for the RSVP's, Thank You cards, and for holiday cards. So, it may be time consuming now, but it is worth it in the end!! Just my two cents! (BTW-I love you color scheme! Very pretty!)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i261.photobucket.com\/albums\/ii54\/Mugals\/Summer2008-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i261.photobucket.com\/albums\/i...mmer2008-1.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mugals@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1198677790,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208056.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"WSUgal","Id":208056,"Name":"WSUgal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14821,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"88b18ffa35a25991eed42879651fd48a","RawContent":"I was also going to suggest labels, and we to used them on the RSVP&#039;s and will use them for thank you&#039;s etc. a little bit of time up front saves so much time down the track.I wonder if you can buy gold or silver labels? and then you could print directly on them in chocolate.. mmm now that I suggest that I am going to google coloured labels..","Attachments":[],"Id":270910,"PostDate":1208425688,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I was also going to suggest labels, and we to used them on the RSVP's and will use them for thank you's etc. a little bit of time up front saves so much time down the track.I wonder if you can buy gold or silver labels? and then you could print directly on them in chocolate.. mmm now that I suggest that I am going to google coloured labels..\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;6\/st\/20080712\/e\/we+are+married%21\/dt\/15\/k\/7b9a\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...7b9a\/event.png<\/a><br><i>Every day, say I Love You<\/i><\/div><\/div>","Email":"amanda_brownhill@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1200635487,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208276.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"manda0812","Id":208276,"Name":"manda0812","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14821,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"38a2025c5887530fe45b5dcf8d9af95a","RawContent":"I used both Silver and Gold paint pens with my chocolate envelopes. I actually prefer using the Gold one since it stands out quite well.","Attachments":[],"Id":271029,"PostDate":1208436519,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I used both Silver and Gold paint pens with my chocolate envelopes. I actually prefer using the Gold one since it stands out quite well.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Baby_G<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cCEP-WmB0700MDAyMzJzfDIwNzQ2NXN8T3VyIFdlZGRpbmc.gif\">http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cCEP-WmB07...FdlZGRpbmc.gif<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cupid_chau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1205951723,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208859.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Baby_G","Id":208859,"Name":"Baby_G","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14821,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5fbc8bd846fc519ba6b01575729e7a4d","RawContent":"What about these? Paper Source has lots of different colored labels. You could use these ivory labels with chocolate colored ink? You could also get a small circle sticker to seal the back of the envelope to match. \n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.paper-source.com\/cgi-bin\/paper\/37110166.html?cm_id=2540.070\"&gt;Superfine Soft White File Folder Labels - Paper Source&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":271102,"PostDate":1208440647,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                What about these? Paper Source has lots of different colored labels. You could use these ivory labels with chocolate colored ink? You could also get a small circle sticker to seal the back of the envelope to match. <br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.paper-source.com\/cgi-bin\/paper\/37110166.html?cm_id=2540.070' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Superfine Soft White File Folder Labels - Paper Source<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"savalina2008@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1199685637,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208155.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Opice34","Id":208155,"Name":"Opice34","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14821,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dda84c00baaedda2079d0be780b81c38","RawContent":"sarah, i have an answer for you about my laser printer at work -- its the xerox phaser 7300N","Attachments":[],"Id":271400,"PostDate":1208449858,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                sarah, i have an answer for you about my laser printer at work -- its the xerox phaser 7300N\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mwall.hernandez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.179.124.226","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1192196100,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207843.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Maura","Id":207843,"Name":"Maura","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14821,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bdb05382cf8f5eee642afd517283d155","RawContent":"Thanks for all of your suggestions! \n \n I am going to play around with the gold pen and I will also try a wrap around label and see which one I like the best. I already started working on a design for a label, and I might go in this direction because I could use it over again for invites. I will have to go to the craft store and get some supplies. Here is the prototype of the label. \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i261.photobucket.com\/albums\/ii65\/Myda77\/STD-addresslabelpart2copy.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":272072,"PostDate":1208484059,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for all of your suggestions! <br \/> <br \/> I am going to play around with the gold pen and I will also try a wrap around label and see which one I like the best. I already started working on a design for a label, and I might go in this direction because I could use it over again for invites. I will have to go to the craft store and get some supplies. Here is the prototype of the label. <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i261.photobucket.com\/albums\/ii65\/Myda77\/STD-addresslabelpart2copy.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Maida & Tomas<\/span><br><span>Circa 2004 - Our first picture together!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"msharpe77@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1202538325,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208514.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Myda77","Id":208514,"Name":"Myda77","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14821,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"379e0d7cf1bd72cf16209e35252ea6d3","RawContent":"Hi Myda,\n \n We have the same wedding colors. Do you mind if I borrow your ribbon pix?\n \n Thanks in advance!","Attachments":[],"Id":457580,"PostDate":1222012134,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Myda,<br \/> <br \/> We have the same wedding colors. Do you mind if I borrow your ribbon pix?<br \/> <br \/> Thanks in advance!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>~*~The best revenge is living your life well~*~<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mariazita_macatangay@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1221876206,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211839.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mikandtet","Id":211839,"Name":"mikandtet","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":14821,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"03c2c8769d8c8f2923126084a3577b63","RawContent":"I also chose chocolate envelopes, and I printed the addresses myself using an aqua metallic marker type pen that I found at a scrapbooking store. It worked out really well, the color shows up great, and it shows the address very clearly. Also, it really pulled the color scheme together! I will post a pic just as soon as I can to show you!","Attachments":[],"Id":458098,"PostDate":1222056683,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I also chose chocolate envelopes, and I printed the addresses myself using an aqua metallic marker type pen that I found at a scrapbooking store. It worked out really well, the color shows up great, and it shows the address very clearly. Also, it really pulled the color scheme together! I will post a pic just as soon as I can to show you!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10;4\/st\/20090919\/e\/We+begin+our+forever%21%21\/k\/1ac2\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...1ac2\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kristynvinceswedding@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1201589561,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208398.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":69,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"VinceBride2B","Id":208398,"Name":"VinceBride2B","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":22,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
