&lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;All these centerpieces are georgeous. Are you guys bringing them down with you? I just don&#039;t know how to fit everything I need to bring in my suitcases....&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;That&#039;s what I am wondering too. I am hoping that the resort can provide them, still waiting to hear back from the WC.","Attachments":[],"Id":124635,"PostDate":1192292491,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>pouchie<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">All these centerpieces are georgeous. Are you guys bringing them down with you? I just don't know how to fit everything I need to bring in my suitcases....<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>That's what I am wondering too. I am hoping that the resort can provide them, still waiting to hear back from the WC.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Sharon & Paul<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i215.photobucket.com\/albums\/cc145\/