1;116\/st\/20080215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/1f03\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...1f03\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tfafara1758@wowway.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1187644153,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207650.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chicago88","Id":207650,"Name":"chicago88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4d16e102606d0d653f2446cf264607b7","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;chicago88&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Thanks for sharing - very cute idea&#039;s...\n \n I&#039;m not sure what I am going to do yet. I know I already have a ton of stuff to bring with. Hmmm...\n \n Does anyone know if Chandlyn at the ROR has any centerpieces that we can choose from?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Yes, but they&#039;re PRICEY!!! They&#039;re all posted in another Jamaica thread (I can&#039;t find them!) I&#039;d look...but on my way into a LONG meeting...","Attachments":[],"Id":135754,"PostDate":1194372812,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>chicago88<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Thanks for sharing - very cute idea's...<br \/> <br \/> I'm not sure what I am going to do yet. I know I already have a ton of stuff to bring with. Hmmm...<br \/> <br \/> Does anyone know if Chandlyn at the ROR has any centerpieces that we can choose from?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Yes, but they're PRICEY!!! They're all posted in another Jamaica thread (I can't find them!) I'd look...but on my way into a LONG meeting...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Married April 4, 2008 at the Riu Ocho Rios!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"hln321@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1174582020,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207275.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Heidi","Id":207275,"Name":"Heidi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"423e39509e9ad1a2a14127c73c1cfdaf","RawContent":"This is so overdue but so many girls asked me who I used for my florist in Cabo and I didn&#039;t have the phone number for them and couldn&#039;t remember the name...I know what kind of bride am I?\n \n Well the other day I was browsing through our wedding pics and time down in Cabo and this is what I cam across a pic that our friend took of us going into the flower shop\n \n Hope this helps some of you out if you are still looking for a florist\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i94.photobucket.com\/albums\/l89\/edytalorek\/IMG_0133.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":168090,"PostDate":1200328221,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This is so overdue but so many girls asked me who I used for my florist in Cabo and I didn't have the phone number for them and couldn't remember the name...I know what kind of bride am I?<br \/> <br \/> Well the other day I was browsing through our wedding pics and time down in Cabo and this is what I cam across a pic that our friend took of us going into the flower shop<br \/> <br \/> Hope this helps some of you out if you are still looking for a florist<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i94.photobucket.com\/albums\/l89\/edytalorek\/IMG_0133.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-lim