Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":9,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1071,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1215927,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":229748,"Name":"miss_delerium","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229748.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":64,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1279118410,"LastPoster":{"Id":285438,"Name":"jonesharry","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285438.png?_r=1456302282","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":74,"Preview":{"Id":1215927,"PostDate":1279118410,"PostContent":"I am making boarding pass invites, and originally I wanted to have a \"tear off\" RSVP on the side....","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"miss_delerium@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1277920721,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229748.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":64,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"miss_delerium","Id":229748,"Name":"miss_delerium","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":54272,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f5abcc0367a3d8a65c401a19b6eda53b","RawContent":"&lt;font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"&gt;I am making boarding pass invites, and originally I wanted to have a &amp;quot;tear off&amp;quot; RSVP on the side. We found out from the post office that there is actually a minimum size that things need to be to be sent through the mail, otherwise you have to put more than double the postage on!\n \n So FI suggested we get little envelopes that meet the size requirements and people can still &amp;quot;tear off&amp;quot; the RSVP (because I &lt;i&gt;really&lt;\/i&gt; wanted the &amp;quot;tear off&amp;quot; factor); they&#039;ll just have to put them in an envelope to send them back. \n \n Now the problem is I can&#039;t find any envelopes that are small enough to fit in the &amp;quot;#10&amp;quot; envelopes I bought (beautiful navy blue coloured ones that I LOVE)!! So I bought the smallest envelopes I could find and FI said we could just fold them and put them inbehind the boarding passes, so it&#039;s not the first thing people will see when they open their invite.\n \n But now I&#039;m second guessing this? What do you ladies think? Will this look tacky and horrible??&lt;\/font&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1215927,"PostDate":1279118410,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <font face=\"Comic Sans MS\">I am making boarding pass invites, and originally I wanted to have a \"tear off\" RSVP on the side. We found out from the post office that there is actually a minimum size that things need to be to be sent through the mail, otherwise you have to put more than double the postage on!<br \/> <br \/> So FI suggested we get little envelopes that meet the size requirements and people can still \"tear off\" the RSVP (because I <i>really<\/i> wanted the \"tear off\" factor); they'll just have to put them in an envelope to send them back. <br \/> <br \/> Now the problem is I can't find any envelopes that are small enough to fit in the \"#10\" envelopes I bought (beautiful navy blue coloured ones that I LOVE)!! So I bought the smallest envelopes I could find and FI said we could just fold them and put them inbehind the boarding passes, so it's not the first thing people will see when they open their invite.<br \/> <br \/> But now I'm second guessing this? What do you ladies think? Will this look tacky and horrible??<\/font>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"miss_delerium@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1277920721,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229748.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":64,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"miss_delerium","Id":229748,"Name":"miss_delerium","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":54272,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c728669ef7671bf72a69f4cf5909c839","RawContent":"How about a postcard RSVP, not sure if you can get that in a tear off, but you dont have to have an envelope for those, you can just stick a stamp right on them and they can send them right back to you.","Attachments":[],"Id":1215978,"PostDate":1279120398,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                How about a postcard RSVP, not sure if you can get that in a tear off, but you dont have to have an envelope for those, you can just stick a stamp right on them and they can send them right back to you.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brandyhashconst_1@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"173.13.232.109","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1274887894,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228585.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Brandy","Id":228585,"Name":"Brandy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":54272,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cc0dd8a653420560ce6ad54a5990eac8","RawContent":"I would just fold them. Honestly, if I got an invite with a folded return envelope, I wouldn&#039;t think twice about it. But, that&#039;s just me....","Attachments":[],"Id":1216058,"PostDate":1279124278,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I would just fold them. Honestly, if I got an invite with a folded return envelope, I wouldn't think twice about it. But, that's just me....\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karlasmith7@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1236623863,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215637.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"*Karla*","Id":215637,"Name":"*Karla*","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":54272,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fcf29ac1bd95b29a64f0657ded657065","RawContent":"I believe that the #10 envelope is 4 1\/8&amp;quot; x 9 1\/2&amp;quot; so a 4 Bar envelope (3 5\/8&amp;quot; x 5 1\/8&amp;quot;) would fit inside. You can buy 4 bar envelopes in several colors from paperandmore.com. I order a ton of paper from them and really like the company.\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/paperandmore.com\/cat-metallic-envelopes.html\"&gt;Pearlescent Metallic Envelopes, 27 Colors - Paperandmore.com&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1216068,"PostDate":1279124922,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I believe that the #10 envelope is 4 1\/8\" x 9 1\/2\" so a 4 Bar envelope (3 5\/8\" x 5 1\/8\") would fit inside. You can buy 4 bar envelopes in several colors from paperandmore.com. I order a ton of paper from them and really like the company.<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/paperandmore.com\/cat-metallic-envelopes.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Pearlescent Metallic Envelopes, 27 Colors - Paperandmore.com<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"afischbeck@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.112.22.70","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1239914966,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216783.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"autjo","Id":216783,"Name":"autjo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":54272,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8a46d49f27d661ec84c768ab0951666b","RawContent":"This is a Paperandmore 4 Bar Dark Blue Pearlescent Metallic envelope that I embossed. It might give you an idea of the color if you want navy...\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/47945512\/personalized-beach-embossed-tears-of-joy\"&gt;Personalized Beach Embossed Tears of Joy Packs 50 by AutumnJo&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1216078,"PostDate":1279125091,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This is a Paperandmore 4 Bar Dark Blue Pearlescent Metallic envelope that I embossed. It might give you an idea of the color if you want navy...<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/47945512\/personalized-beach-embossed-tears-of-