2\/personalized-beach-embossed-tears-of-joy' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Personalized Beach Embossed Tears of Joy Packs 50 by AutumnJo<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"afischbeck@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.112.22.70","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1239914966,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216783.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"autjo","Id":216783,"Name":"autjo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":54272,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a52254a18f76fd8e41f7128bcb742df2","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;autjo&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I believe that the #10 envelope is 4 1\/8&amp;quot; x 9 1\/2&amp;quot; so a 4 Bar envelope (3 5\/8&amp;quot; x 5 1\/8&amp;quot;) would fit inside. You can buy 4 bar envelopes in several colors from paperandmore.com. I order a ton of paper from them and really like the company.\n \n &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I would just fold them. Honestly, if I got an invite with a folded return envelope, I wouldn&#039;t think twice about it. But, that&#039;s just me....&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;&lt;font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"&gt;This makes me feel a little better about folding them if I can&#039;t hunt down the &amp;quot;4 bar&amp;quot; envelopes in the next 2 days &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/undecided.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Undecided\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; Thanks Karla.&lt;\/font&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1216106,"PostDate":1279125967,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>autjo<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I believe that the #10 envelope is 4 1\/8\" x 9 1\/2\" so a 4 Bar envelope (3 5\/8\" x 5 1\/8\") would fit inside. You can buy 4 bar envelopes in several colors from paperandmore.com. I order a ton of paper from them and really like the company.<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I would just fold them. Honestly, if I got an invite with a folded return envelope, I wouldn't think twice about it. But, that's just me....<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><font face=\"Comic Sans MS\">This makes me feel a little better about folding them if I can't hunt down the \"4 bar\" envelopes in the next 2 days <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/undecided.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Undecided\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> Thanks Karla.<\/font>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"miss_delerium@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1277920721,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229748.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":64,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"miss_delerium","Id":229748,"Name":"miss_delerium","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":54272,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"597710e92d3fc3580b9023b76dd0bb32","RawContent":"Don&#039;t worry about it sweetie! Just fold the envelopes you have and it will be perfect. I don&#039;t think it looks bad at all.","Attachments":[],"Id":1216481,"PostDate":1279135585,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Don't worry about it sweetie! Just fold the envelopes you have and it will be perfect. I don't think it looks bad at all.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"afischbeck@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.112.22.70","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1239914966,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216783.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"autjo","Id":216783,"Name":"autjo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"125.62.127.94","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":54272,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"722a35f9d5523b6daccbb50c36a26b3d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have never seen a folded RSVP envelope.&amp;nbsp;Although, it obviously could be done.  It seems to me you have this beautiful invitation and then a folded RSVP envelope might seem odd.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911317,"PostDate":1456359257,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have never seen a folded RSVP envelope.\u00a0Although, it obviously could be done.\u00a0\u00a0It seems to me you have this beautiful invitation and then a folded RSVP envelope might seem odd.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jonesharry@zoho.com","IpAddress":"125.62.124.171","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1448500593,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285438.png?_r=1456302282","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jonesharry","Id":285438,"Name":"jonesharry","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"54272","Title":"Folding RSVP Envelopes?","LastPostDate":1456359257},"Pages":{"TotalItems":9,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
